=head1 DESCRIPTION

A recovery option for a user. The C<AccountRecoverySettingType> data
type is an array of this object. Each C<RecoveryOptionType> has a
priority property that determines whether it is a primary or secondary
option.

For example, if C<verified_email> has a priority of C<1> and
C<verified_phone_number> has a priority of C<2>, your user pool sends
account-recovery messages to a verified email address but falls back to
an SMS message if the user has a verified phone number. The
C<admin_only> option prevents self-service account recovery.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Name => Str

The recovery method that this object sets a recovery option for.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Priority => Int

Your priority preference for using the specified attribute in account
recovery. The highest priority is C<1>.



